# Retired URLs from the 2026-07-20 restructure (68 pages -> 52).
#
# Cloudflare matches the source EXACTLY, so every rule needs both the slashed
# and unslashed form — html_handling cannot rescue a path whose asset is gone.
# Rules also default to 302 and override existing assets, so the status is
# always explicit and no live path may appear on the left. scripts/
# verify-build.mjs asserts all of this at build time, because Cloudflare treats
# a malformed rule as a warning and ships the 404.

